//! The `padding-inline` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS)
//! [shorthand](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Cascade/Shorthand_properties)
//! property defines the logical inline start and end padding of an element, which maps to physical
//! padding properties depending on the element's writing mode, directionality, and text orientation.
